# Data Modeling Projects

This repository contains hands-on projects demonstrating the fundamentals of **Data Modeling and Regression Analysis** using Python and Scikit-learn.

## Topics Covered

* Simple Linear Regression
* Multiple Linear Regression
* Regression, Residual, and Distribution Plots
* Polynomial Regression
* Feature Engineering and Data Standardization
* Scikit-learn Pipelines
* Model Evaluation using Mean Squared Error (MSE) and R² Score

## Technologies Used

* Python
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Matplotlib
* Seaborn
* Scikit-learn
* Jupyter Notebook

## Key Learning Outcomes

* Built and evaluated regression models for predictive analysis.
* Applied feature engineering and data preprocessing techniques.
* Automated machine learning workflows using pipelines.
* Assessed model performance using visualization and evaluation metrics.
* Compared models to identify the best fit while recognizing underfitting and overfitting.
